# SearchField

> Lede 0.6.0's docs for SearchField, installed with it. Setup, and every item in the release: [README.md](README.md). Online: https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/search-field.md

An `<input type="search">` with a visually hidden label and a clear button. Escape clears its text, and on an empty field goes on to PageHeader's `backOnEscape`.

## Install

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add @lede/search-field @lede/list
```

The command needs Lede's registry in `components.json`, as [README.md](README.md#use-it-in-a-shadcn-project) shows. It also installs the items [`lede-theme`](lede-theme.md) and [`lede-utils`](lede-utils.md). It adds [`list`](https://lede.cloudcompute.com/reference/list.md) only because the example below imports it. The item's JSON, with each file's source, is https://lede.cloudcompute.com/r/v0.6.0/search-field.json.

## Import

```tsx
import { SearchField } from '@/components/lede/search-field';
```

